cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata in this file.
  Cite the published Knowledge Graph dataset separately when using the data.
title: Knowledge Graph-Based Recommender Systems for Drug Repositioning
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Gonçalo
    family-names: dos Reis Garranha
    affiliation: Instituto Superior de Engenharia de Lisboa, Instituto Politécnico de Lisboa
repository-code: https://github.com/GoncaloGarranha/drug-recommender-system
url: https://github.com/GoncaloGarranha/drug-recommender-system
abstract: >-
  Software for constructing a biomedical Knowledge Graph and training and
  evaluating recommendation models that rank candidate drugs for a queried
  disease. The repository includes the graph-construction workflow, an R-GCN
  model with a DistMult decoder, reference methods and reproducible evaluation
  configurations.
keywords:
  - drug repositioning
  - knowledge graph
  - recommender system
  - link prediction
  - R-GCN
